# How the cannon looks and sounds (reactions_cannon.tscn reads this sheet; docs/looks.md, Rules
# sheets). The balls need nothing here: they are items, drawn from their own scene.

# Fired
on cannon.fired
	subject $at
	at point
	sound res://assets/sfx/impact.wav volume 4 pitch 0.45 jitter 0.05 range 60
	shake 0.12 time 0.2

# A wall broken where a ball hit it (said by the simulation: on the same tick on every screen)
on cannon.ball.smash
	subject $at
	at point
	sound res://assets/sfx/prop_destroy.wav volume 2 pitch 0.7 jitter 0.1 range 70
	scene res://vfx/dust.tscn life 2.5
